It's also easy to add an image into a panel or other container using its xtype:

    @example
    Ext.create('Ext.Panel', {
        fullscreen: true,
        layout: 'hbox',
        items: [
            {
                xtype: 'image',
                src: 'http://www.sencha.com/assets/images/sencha-avatar-64x64.png',
