When passing a single string argument to sort, the `direction` is maintained for
each field and is toggled automatically. So this code:

    store.sort('myField');
    store.sort('myField');

Is equivalent to the following:

    store.sort('myField', 'ASC');
    store.sort('myField', 'DESC');

This method calls the supplied function `fn` between `{@link #method!beginUpdate beginUpdate}` and `{@link #method!endUpdate endUpdate}`
calls.

