Updates the sorters collection and triggers sorting of this Sortable. Example usage:

    //sort by a single field
    myStore.sort('myField', 'DESC');

    //sorting by multiple fields
    myStore.sort([{
        property : 'age',
        direction: 'ASC'
    }, {
